  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>Summer's Edge Seas the Day<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>You’ve hit vacation gold with this lovely, three-bedroom home, within walking distance of several beach access points and Hwy. 30A, lined with shops and restaurants. Hop on one of the provided bikes and cruise 30A via the parallel Timpoochee Trail, just down the street. If you want to explore further afield, it’s an easy drive to state parks, golf courses, and more. You’ll also have access to two community pools, one heated. <br><br><br><br>At home, enjoy morning coffee on the oversized front porch, furnished with several Adirondack rocking chairs. Inside, you’ll find an open, light-filled living space featuring modern furnishings, hardwood floors, and lots of space to gather. The chef will love the full kitchen’s stainless steel appliances and ample counter space, and little helpers will love perching at the breakfast bar to taste test. After a family meal at the large dining table, step out to explore. When you return, toss the day’s beach gear in the washer/dryer for a quick refresh, then relax in the central AC while you watch some TV or head upstairs to the balcony with some sweet tea and a good book. Fire up the gas grill for an easy family dinner, then drift off to sleep in any of the well-appointed bedrooms - another gorgeous 30A day awaits tomorrow.<br><br><br><br><b>THINGS TO KNOW</b>",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Coastal home with 2 community pools, bikes, front porch & balcony - near beach"
        }
      ],
